{"candidateAnswer":"Gastritis","evidence":"[D14:1 | 1:50 pm on 17 October, 2023] Sam: Hey Evan! I've been missing our chats. I had quite the health scare last weekend - ended up in the ER with a severe stomachache. Turns out, it was gastritis, which was pretty alarming. It was a wake-up call for me to start prioritizing my health, like adopting a more nutritious diet and getting regular exercise. On top of that, my phone's been giving me a hard time, adding to the stress.","itemId":"urn:uuid:cafe8b3a-5c30-5906-9f93-1caee3b79853","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:a6cbaaa17aead42adaef7abffe0193a7538ba1725ffab2b3c4d137a834603111","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What digestive issue did Sam experience lately?","referenceAnswer":"Gastritis","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"a6cbaaa17aead42adaef7abffe0193a7538ba1725ffab2b3c4d137a834603111"}}]}